{"id":"confe_rence","lemma":"conférence","pos":"noun","rank":1598,"glosses":["conference","lecture; talk"],"ipa":"/kɔ̃.fe.ʁɑ̃s/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/1e/Fr-conf%C3%A9rence.ogg/Fr-conf%C3%A9rence.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"conférences"},"formAudio":{"conférences":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/be/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-conf%C3%A9rences.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La conférence commence à trois heures.","en":"The meeting begins at three.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to begin, commence","l":"commencer"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"three"},{"g":"hour, time","l":"heure"}]},{"text":"Cette conférence a lieu chaque année.","en":"This conference takes place every year.","words":[{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"place"},{"g":"each"},{"g":"year"}]},{"text":"Cette conférence a lieu tous les ans.","en":"This conference takes place every year.","words":[{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"place"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"year","l":"an"}]},{"text":"Ramène cette chaise dans la salle de conférences !","en":"Take this chair back to the meeting room.","words":[{"g":"to take back","l":"ramener"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"chair, seat"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"room, hall"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"La conférence finira demain.","en":"The conference will end tomorrow.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to finish","l":"finir"},{"g":"tomorrow"}]}]}